{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48469","headline":"孙咸题庐山神庙诗 · 不详","name":"孙咸题庐山神庙诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"独入玄宫礼至真，焚香不爲贱贫身。\n秦淮两岸沙埋骨，湓浦千家血染尘。\n庐阜烟霞谁是主，虎溪风月属何人。\n九江太守勤王室，好放天兵渡要津。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48469.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48469","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}